      "text": "say unto righteous it is well with them, 2 Ne. 13:10 (Isa. 3:10). Satan lulls men into carnal security, saying, All is well in Zion, 2 Ne. 28:21. wo unto him that crieth, All is well, 2 Ne. 28:25. people accept false prophets because they say all is well, Hel. 13:27–28. it shall be well with those who are baptized with water and with fire, Morm. 7:10. whoso is found possessed of charity at last day, it shall be well with him, Moro. 7:47.",
